Package: TVFundSelect
Type: Package
Title: Robust Mutual Fund Selection with Time-Varying Coefficients
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Long", "Feng", email = "flnankai@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Selects funds with positive average alpha using spatial-sign and
    least-squares procedures in time-varying and constant-coefficient factor
    models. Includes ordinary residual-bootstrap local-linear screening, coefficient-constancy tests,
    fresh Monte Carlo experiments, data-calibrated experiments, rolling
    investment evaluation and reproducible workflows for the October 27,
    2026 manuscript 'Robust Mutual Fund Selection with Time-Varying Alphas
    and Factor Loadings'. Reproduction regenerates data and refits models;
    it does not substitute archived result tables for computation.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, splines, parallel, graphics, grDevices, utils, tools
URL: https://github.com/flnankai/TVFundSelect
BugReports: https://github.com/flnankai/TVFundSelect/issues
NeedsCompilation: no
